# ENV REGISTER: a verdict for every setting this serve reads, from the engine's own table.
# One line per setting the launcher does not set: default-ok (with its measurement),
# debt (explicit and counted, to be measured) or unreachable (with the reason).
# check-env-coverage.py fails on any setting with no line and on any line with no setting.


# Added by update-env-register.py against tensorfol.
# debt TF_FLASHNEXT_BATCH_DRAWS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (0 restores per-stream Flash Next row draws; default 1); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_STARTUP_RECEIPT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (opt-in startup and first completion receipts); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_VIDEO_TOKENS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a nonnegative whole video-token budget (default 16384; unsigned 64-bit count); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_MAX_PDF_PAGES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4294967295 (capped by --vision-max-images); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PRESSURE_CACHE_PERCENT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole percentage from 0 to 100; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PREFIX_WAIT_MS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms whole milliseconds from 0 to 4294967295 (0 disables waiting); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit read count (0 disables reading ahead; capped at 65536); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH_GIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit GiB count (capped at 16777216); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_RESTORE_PREFETCH_MS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms whole unsigned 64-bit milliseconds (capped at 1099511627776); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_TOOL_ID_KEY_FILE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a path without control characters to a file only its owner can read, holding at least 32 key bytes; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_CUDA_KERNELS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a captured kernel set's folder without control characters, or native for the engine's own kernels; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_DEVICE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole GPU ordinal from 0 to 4294967295, or empty for the default; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_SEGMENTS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 1 to 4, or empty for the default; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_CUDA_CARVEOUT_MIB: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a positive whole MiB count fitting a native byte size, or empty for 1792 MiB; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_MTP_DRAFTS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole number from 0 to 4294967295 (clamped to the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_DSPINE_WINDOW: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole row count from 16 to 8192, at most the DSpine drafter's own sliding_window; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_DRAFT_NODES: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size node count (capped by the drafter's window); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_QMMF_HALF_BELOW: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole nonnegative native-size block count (0 disables half tiles); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TENSORFOLD_PROMPT_CACHE_KEEP_OTHERS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_PROMPT_INTERMEDIATE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1 (default 0); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_ROCE_GID_INDEX: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole GID index from 0 to 2147483647; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_HOST_CACHE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_VISION_HOST: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PROF: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_LINK_WAIT: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PDL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_PROMPT_STEPS: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_SHARED: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DSEL: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms 0 or 1; evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DFLASH2_LOG: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a whole unsigned 64-bit round count (0 logs no drafts); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
# debt TF_GLM_DRAFT_CONFIDENCE: new in the table at tensorfol, not measured on this stack; forms a finite chain-chance cut from 0 to 1 (default 0.7); evidence docs/ENV-REGISTER.md
